<title>LATVIA: ROTA1 PRINTER BACK ON BOURSE.</title>
<headline>ROTA1 PRINTER BACK ON BOURSE.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Riga Stock Exchange said on Thursday that it has renewed the quotation of Rota1 printing house.</p>
<p>Rota1, a secondary list stock, was suspended on February 4 ahaed of a merger with Rota3. The latter is excluded from the bourses list and its shares are now annulled.</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
